  "routeSelection": {
    "route": "Politics, History and Economics",
    "selectionRule": "official-order-tiebreak",
    "basis": "The two formal routes share the first-year foundation and the same 20 EC specialization allocation in each later year. Neither is privileged for the generic degree title. The adopted regulations and Study Guide list Politics, History and Economics first, independently of UCR fit."
