        ],
        "outcome": "not-defensible",
        "assessment": "Modern History includes the Russian Revolution, the Soviet Union and the Cold War. Comparative empire, politics, law and economics offer useful methods and context, with no sustained upper-level sequence on Soviet and post-Soviet society, Russian institutions, economy and foreign policy."
      }
